Provide psychological leadership, consultation and direct[ services].[ Collabor]ate with mult[idisciplinary] team in providing assessment and treatment of mental and emotional disorders of patients.[
]Ph.D. or Psy.D. from an accredited institution required; Ph.D. or Psy.D. in Clinical Psychology preferred.
