=== Text #1 ===
> You can't say it's not thoroughly deserved. Two impressive achievements by Claudio[ March]isio rightly called for a standing ovation from the[ Juventus] Stadium faithful before the match against Cagliari. And Il[ Princ]ipino duly collected two awards for his efforts[ following] the pre-match warm-up.
[First] there was a[ commemor]ative plaque for his 300th[ Bian]coneri appearance – which came against Fiorentina last week – handed to him by president[ Andrea] Agnelli.
Then it was time for[ J-Member] Martina Divis to hand him the[ MVP] of the[ Month] Powered[ By] Han[wh]a[ award] for[ April] on[ behalf] of the[ Juventus Membership community].[
]A[ memorable] night for[ March]isio and an[ unforgettable] one for Martina, who got to meet one of her heroes while soaking up the pre[-match] atmosphere on the hallowed[ J-]Stadium[ turf].
[Next] time you could be the[ lucky J-Member] doing the honours[! You] just need to go to the[ ON THE P]ITCH[ >] Fixtures and Results[ section] and vote for your man of the match after every game[.
If] you haven't joined the[ JuventusMembers]hip family yet, don't delay[:] do it today[!] For more details, see here.[ #We]Are[One]!

